{"record_type":"timeline-node","type":"event","timestamp":"2026-10-28T12:53:05.269Z","data":{"event":{"id":"evt_182924073001aOpIeFcySP94lp","type":"message.part.updated","properties":{"sessionID":"ses_e7d7ba936ffeOnBhTlKsfisQhw","part":{"id":"prt_182923278001m529f84pmPmiUb","messageID":"msg_1829215190019XrLUu4s6Xq3fj","sessionID":"ses_e7d7ba936ffeOnBhTlKsfisQhw","type":"text","text":"## Prepared\n\n- `research/datasets/natural-v1.annotator-a.csv`\n- `research/datasets/natural-v1.annotator-b.csv`\n\nEach worksheet has 40 sessions × 10 claim slots and includes session ID, prompt, final response, and full evidence references. Predicted claims/verdicts are absent (`traceforge_verdict`, `gold_verdict`, `goldClaims`, `extractor_model` not present). Existing dataset, blank `natural-v1.annotations.csv`, and bundled benchmark results were not modified.\n\nAdded:\n\n- `research/annotation/prepare-worksheets.mjs`\n- `research/annotation/build-adjudicated-dataset.mjs`\n- `research/annotation/run-evaluation-suite.mjs`\n- `research/annotation/adjudication-template.csv`\n- `research/annotation/README.md`\n- `test/research-annotation-tools.test.ts`\n\nThe converter requires exact response quotes, valid claim types/verdicts, both independent annotator verdicts, `adjudication_status=ADJUDICATED`, valid evidence event IDs, and complete session coverage. It refuses blank/incomplete files and preserves the original evidence array.\n\n## Current data status\n\n- 40 sessions, 52 system-predicted claims, 12 zero-claim sessions.\n- 0 gold claims and all 40 existing annotation rows are blank.\n- No `natural-v1.adjudications.csv` and no `natural-v1-adjudicated.jsonl` were created.\n- Running the converter against the existing blank worksheet fails: missing `test_tampering`, `session_status`, `adjudication_status`, `adjudicator_id`, `adjudicated_at`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- TypeScript build/typecheck: passed.\n- New annotation-tool tests: 4 passed.\n- Full suite: 133 passed.\n- Synthetic `evaluation.example.jsonl` smoke test: 3 sessions, 0 failures. This is not paper evidence.\n- `qwen3:4b` is installed locally; the runner is configured to use it.\n- Evaluation dry run confirmed four fresh output directories and direct Node commands.\n\n## Not run\n\nThe requested natural-v1 evaluations were **not run** because genuine human adjudications do not exist. No system predictions were copied into ground truth.\n\nRequired human work:\n\n1. Two annotators independently complete their A/B worksheets.\n2. An adjudicator creates `research/datasets/natural-v1.adjudications.csv` using `research/annotation/adjudication-template.csv`.\n3. Then run:\n\n```powershell\nnode research/annotation/build-adjudicated-dataset.mjs --dry-run\nnode research/annotation/build-adjudicated-dataset.mjs\nnode research/annotation/run-evaluation-suite.mjs --dry-run\nnode research/annotation/run-evaluation-suite.mjs\n```\n\nFor truly claim-free sessions, the adjudication row must use `session_status=NO_CLAIMS` and set all three verdict fields to `NO_CLAIMS`. Every session must appear, and every verdict must be explicitly adjudicated.","time":{"start":1793191981688,"end":1793191985267}},"time":1793191985267}}}}
