olean) : null;\nconst selected = only ? evaluations.filter(e=>only.some(prefix=>e.name===prefix||e.name.startsWith(prefix))) : evaluations;\nif(only && selected.length===0) throw...\n```\nUse selected in loop. Also maybe `--list`. Not needed.\n\nThen run fast.","time":{"start":1793192590675,"end":1793192596204}},"time":1793192596205}}}}
