{"record_type":"timeline-node","type":"event","timestamp":"2026-10-28T13:05:27.500Z","data":{"event":{"id":"evt_1829d93c7001Ju18Sg3zCKa0tO","type":"message.part.updated","properties":{"sessionID":"ses_e7d7ba936ffeOnBhTlKsfisQhw","part":{"id":"prt_1829d711e0014SUTNWme6kfU5i","messageID":"msg_1829d3609001E1EDE0WxPGSoIv","sessionID":"ses_e7d7ba936ffeOnBhTlKsfisQhw","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Prepare and evaluate the TraceForge paper dataset, now expanded to reviewer-ready >5x data with full experiments, CSV exports, failure fixes, and final outcomes.\n- Preserve scientific validity: do not fabricate human labels, copy system predictions into gold, or mark unfinished annotations adjudicated.\n\n## Important Details\n- Constraints: direct Node commands only; fresh evaluation output directories; preserve existing files and bundled benchmark results; use `qwen3:4b`.\n- Natural-v1 remains 40 sessions, 52 system-predicted claims, 12 zero-claim sessions, 0 gold claims. `research/datasets/natural-v1.annotations.csv` has 40 blank rows. `data/traceforge.sqlite` also contains only 40 sessions, so natural data cannot be expanded to 200 sessions without new real runs and human annotation.\n- Legitimate >5x source: controlled benchmark `research/benchmark/results/sessions.jsonl` has 200 sessions, 25 families × 8 variants, 216 gold claims, 536 evidence events. `rows.jsonl` has 1,728 system-claim rows across 8 systems. Labels are known by construction, not human-adjudicated.\n- `../tf-old` is missing, so the original 2.0.0 controlled harness cannot be rerun. Bundled controlled results can still be exported and compared.\n- `qwen3:4b` is installed locally. Probe latency: 16.5s cold, ~2.1s warm. Full model evaluations may be slow; consider detached/background execution with polling.\n- Default evaluate model is `qwen3.5:4b`; runner must override with `TRACEFORGE_LLM_MODEL=qwen3:4b` and `TRACEFORGE_JUDGE_MODEL=qwen3:4b`.\n- Controlled labels must use `annotationStatus: \"controlled\"` and `--allow-unadjudicated`, never `\"adjudicated\"`.\n- Existing natural conversion error when pointed at the blank worksheet: `Adjudication CSV is missing required columns: test_tampering, session_status, adjudication_status, adjudicator_id, adjudicated_at`.\n- No `natural-v1.adjudications.csv` and no `natural-v1-adjudicated.jsonl` exist.\n\n## Work State\n\n### Completed\n- Inspected dataset, model, verifier, metrics, benchmark, and judge harness.\n- Created blind worksheets:\n  - `research/datasets/natural-v1.annotator-a.csv`\n  - `research/datasets/natural-v1.annotator-b.csv`\n  - Each: 400 rows, 40 sessions × 10 slots, ~2.2 MB, no `traceforge_verdict`, `gold_verdict`, `goldClaims`, `extractor_model`, or predicted claims.\n- Created annotation tooling:\n  - `research/annotation/lib.mjs`\n  - `research/annotation/prepare-worksheets.mjs`\n  - `research/annotation/build-adjudicated-dataset.mjs`\n  - `research/annotation/run-evaluation-suite.mjs`\n  - `research/annotation/adjudication-template.csv`\n  - `research/annotation/README.md`\n- Conversion validates exact quotes, claim types, both annotator verdicts, `adjudication_status=ADJUDICATED`, evidence IDs, session coverage; rejects incomplete data and preserves evidence.\n- Runner supports oracle/heuristic, Ollama deterministic, LLM judge, and agent judge; dry-run prints direct Node commands and fresh run directories.\n- Created `test/research-annotation-tools.test.ts`: 4/4 tests pass.\n- Full test suite: 133 passed.\n- Typecheck/build passed with direct Node.\n- Synthetic `evaluation.example.jsonl` smoke test: 3 sessions, 0 failures (not paper evidence).\n- Last write completed: `research/annotation/build-controlled-dataset.mjs`, not yet run.\n\n### Active\n- Controlled >5x dataset/export path:\n  - `research/datasets/controlled-v1.jsonl`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/sessions.csv`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/gold-claims.csv`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/evidence.csv`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/benchmark-summary.csv`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/benchmark-families.csv`\n  - `research/exports/controlled-v1/benchmark-per-claim.csv`\n- `build-controlled-dataset.mjs` converts 200 controlled sessions/216 claims and exports the CSVs; needs execution and verification.\n\n### Blocked\n- Natural-session paper experiments cannot run without genuine human annotation/adjudication.\n- Natural 5x expansion is ","time":{"start":1793192718622,"end":1793192727494}},"time":1793192727495}}}}
